TSolov, who only does two years in F3 rather than three years. But we just have to see, because,

19:35.280 --> 19:41.760
I mean, with British F4 is a competitive championship, winning a title there is not easy.

19:42.000 --> 19:48.560
Aside from him, in F3, we also have Ernesto Riviera, who unfortunately missed the Melbourne

